From 9e6024e87433d467a75b85cb999d557a2161019e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Superhsl <2949565071@qq.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 18:38:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] [sdaa-adapt] Add OpenDDE LoongArch SDAA inference support

Adapt device selection, BF16, random seeding and operator compatibility. Add pinned SDAA runtime scripts and reproduction documentation.

The existing SDAA container ran the official 7r6r prepared-MSA example. The new read-only bind mounts have not yet been run in a new container.
